      <p class="eyebrow">Our story</p>
      <h2 id="story-title">Two years in a Harrow kitchen.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <p>Green Leaf Pizza comes from Healthy Bakes, the eggless, free-from bakery Rituja started at home in Harrow.</p>
      <p>She spent two years developing natural, free-from recipes, because every alternative she tried asked you to accept less flavour. She refused to. Healthy food doesn't have to taste bad; it just has to be made properly.</p>
      <p>Pizza was the obvious next question. Could the same care make a pizza with a crisp, blistered edge and a rich tomato heart, with no egg, no dairy, no onion, no garlic, and no compromise? It could.</p>
      <p class="quote">Nothing taken away from the taste. Nobody left out of the table.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
